OL,3,AIndians are discovering the thrill of
OL,4,Ashopping without paying
OL,5,
OL,6,FYou are hungry. Or you are not. It
OL,7,Fdoesn't matter.
OL,9,FYou open FoodNeverComes, pick from 22
OL,10,Fcuisines and start scrolling. Butter
OL,11,Fchicken looks good. So does bibimbap.
OL,12,FYou add a few dishes, watch the total
OL,13,Fclimb and hit checkout. A tracker says
OL,14,Fa rider is on the way.
OL,16,FThen you get a dummy AI-generated call
OL,17,Ffrom inside the site. He is outside
OL,18,Fyour building, he says, but cannot find
OL,19,Fyour street or door. Except there was
OL,20,Fnever any food in the first place. The
OL,21,Forder exists only on the screen.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
