OL,3,AUS rejects pleas from OpenAI, Anthropic
OL,4,Afor global AI standards
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe heads of OpenAI, Anthropic, and
OL,7,FHugging Face have told the UN that the
OL,8,Fcurrent pace of artificial intelligence
OL,9,F(AI) development, and the risks it
OL,10,Fposes to society, demands international
OL,11,Fcoordination.
OL,13,FAltman called for common risk
OL,14,Fevaluation standards, as did Dario
OL,15,FAmodei of Anthropic, a main rival of
OL,16,FOpenAI, and Clement Delangue of Hugging
OL,17,FFace.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,109,105,200,160,0,100
