OL,3,ATeen rocker Nene Royal becomes first
OL,4,AThai to win America's Got Talent
OL,5,
OL,6,FMany in Thailand are celebrating her
OL,7,Fwin, with some saying they were proud
OL,8,Fthat she had made it to "one of the
OL,9,Fbiggest stages in the world". The Thai
OL,10,Fgovernment has called her an
OL,11,F"inspiration to anyone who dares to
OL,12,Fdream big".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
